title: "Emergent Cooperation in Pandemic Resource Allocation"
abstract: "Trains and evaluates multi-agent RL algorithms (IPPO, MAPPO, DQN, and a peer-incentive variant) on a multi-city SEIR-based pandemic simulator in which each city decides whether to transfer scarce ventilator, vaccine, and PPE stockpiles to cities in greater need."
